.TH TILEMAP_SOLID_AT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
tilemap_solid_at \- Whether the tile under world position wx, wy is solid
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtilemap.h\(dq
.BI "bool tilemap_solid_at(const Tilemap *m, float wx, float wy);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Whether the tile under world position wx, wy is solid. Point tests: is the pixel under the mouse a wall, is the ground below a foot solid. Outside the map is not solid.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true if solid.
.SH MODULE
tilemap (src/engine/tilemap/tilemap.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tilemap_box_hits (3),
.BR tilemap_at (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
